mark ^keyword := external global

unless 1B == 8b { INFO@mark `U8 a byte does not equal eight bits` }
unless 8 bits as byte == 1 byte { INFO@mark `UB6 eight bits are not one byte` }
unless 1 byte as bit == 8 bits { INFO@mark `U3 a byte does not convert to eight bits` }
unless 1dab == 10b { INFO@mark `U10 a deka-bit is not ten bits` }

unless 2 bits + 3 bits == 5 bits { INFO@mark `U22 two bits and three bits are not five` }
unless 5 bits - 2 bits == 3 bits { INFO@mark `U23 five bits less two are not three` }
unless 1 byte + 1 bit == 9 bits { INFO@mark `U25 a byte and a bit are not nine bits` }
unless 2 bits < 3 bits { INFO@mark `U26 two bits are not fewer than three` }
if 3 bits < 2 bits { INFO@mark `U27 three bits are fewer than two` }
unless 2 seconds + 3 seconds == 5 seconds { INFO@mark `U40 two and three seconds is not five seconds` }
if 2 seconds + 3 seconds < 5 seconds { INFO@mark `U41 two and three seconds is below five seconds` }

unless 1 minute as seconds == 60 s { INFO@mark `U35 a minute is not sixty seconds` }
unless 2 hours as minutes == 120 minutes { INFO@mark `U46 two hours are not 120 minutes` }
unless 1.5 days as hours == 36 h { INFO@mark `U45 1.5 days is not 36 hours` }
unless 0 °C as kelvin == 273.15 K { INFO@mark `U47 zero celsius is not 273.15 kelvin` }
unless 273.15 K as celsius == 0 °C { INFO@mark `U48 the offset is not reversed` }

unless bit as String == "bit" { INFO@mark `U36 a bit is not called that` }
unless 2 hours as String == "2 hours" { INFO@mark `U42 two hours are not written so` }
unless 3 s == 3 seconds { INFO@mark `U43 three s are not seconds` }
unless 25.years == 25 years { INFO@mark `U49 a unit is not reachable as a member` }
unless 8m == 8 meter | 8 minute { INFO@mark `U50 an ambiguous unit does not superpose` }

unless 1 KiB == 1024 B { INFO@mark `UB3 a kibibyte is not 1024 bytes` }
unless 1 KB == 1000 B { INFO@mark `UB4 a kilobyte is not 1000 bytes` }
if 1 KiB == 1 KB { INFO@mark `UB5 a kibibyte is a kilobyte` }
unless 1 MiB == 1024 KiB { INFO@mark `UB7 mebi is not 1024 kibi` }
unless kibibyte as String == "kibibyte" { INFO@mark `UB10 a kibibyte is not called that` }
unless 2 KiB as String == "2 kibibytes" { INFO@mark `UB12 two kibibytes are not kibibytes` }

unless 1k == 1000 { INFO@mark `UB15 1k is not a thousand` }
unless 2 GB/s * 3 s == 6 GB { INFO@mark `U51 a rate times a duration is not an amount` }
unless 1d 10h 10m 30s as s == 123030 s { INFO@mark `U52 a juxtaposed quantity is not the sum of its parts` }
unless 10000000 s as days hours minutes seconds == 115d 17h 46m 40s { INFO@mark `U53 a quantity is not normalized into days hours minutes seconds` }
